### 脑商AI 后端接口测试（IDEA / WebStorm HTTP Client）
#
# 用法：用 IDEA 打开本文件，每个请求左侧有绿色 ▶ 按钮，点击即可发送。
# 前提：后端已启动（npm start），控制台出现 ✅ 脑商AI 后端已启动: http://localhost:3000
#
# ⚠️ 开发期验证码从 sms/send 响应的 devCode 获取，把它抄到后续用例的 smsCode 里。
# ⚠️ 同一手机号 60 秒内只能发一次码（TOO_FREQUENT），连续跑用例请间隔 60s 或换号码。
#
# 场景隔离：scene=register（注册）与 scene=reset（重置密码）的验证码互不可混用。

###
# ========== 0. 健康检查 ==========
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

###
# ========== 1. 注册流程 ==========

### 1.1 发送验证码（注册场景）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "scene": "register"
}

### 1.2 校验验证码（不消耗）—— 把 1.1 返回的 devCode 填到 smsCode
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sms/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "smsCode": "000000",
  "scene": "register"
}

### 1.3 随机昵称
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/nickname/random

### 1.4 注册第二页可选项（头像/装扮/年级）
GET http://localhost:3000/api/profile/options

### 1.5 注册并登录（返回 token）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "smsCode": "000000",
  "password": "abc12345",
  "confirmPassword": "abc12345",
  "nickname": "摘星的鱼",
  "gender": "male",
  "avatar": "boy-sport",
  "outfit": "m-sport",
  "grade": "三年级"
}

###
# ========== 2. 忘记密码（重置）流程 ==========
# 注意：需先用已注册的手机号；发码用 scene=reset。

### 2.1 发送验证码（重置场景）—— 已注册号码
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "scene": "reset"
}

### 2.2 反例：未注册号码发送重置码 → 404 PHONE_NOT_EXISTS
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13911112222",
  "scene": "reset"
}

### 2.3 反例：非法场景 → 400 INVALID_SCENE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "scene": "hack"
}

### 2.4 校验验证码（重置场景，不消耗）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sms/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "smsCode": "000000",
  "scene": "reset"
}

### 2.5 反例：两次密码不一致 → 400 PWD_MISMATCH
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "smsCode": "000000",
  "password": "new12345",
  "confirmPassword": "other123"
}

### 2.6 反例：弱密码 → 400 WEAK_PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "smsCode": "000000",
  "password": "123",
  "confirmPassword": "123"
}

### 2.7 重置密码（成功，验证码一次性消耗）—— 填对 smsCode
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "smsCode": "000000",
  "password": "new12345",
  "confirmPassword": "new12345"
}

###
# ========== 3. 登录 / 我的信息 ==========

### 3.1 登录（重置后用新密码）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "password": "new12345"
}

### 3.2 当前用户信息 —— 把 3.1 返回的 token 填到下面
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <token>
